<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica Mar manufacturing output slips 0.6 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>SAfrica Mar manufacturing output slips 0.6 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African manufacturing production fell 0.6 percent on a seasonally-adjusted basis in March compared with the same month a year ago, the Central Statistical Service (CSS) said.</p>
<p>Month-on-month, seasonally-adjusted manufacturing production was down 5.8 percent.</p>
<p>Index of the physical volume of manufacturing production</p>
<p>(base 1990=100):</p>
<p>				 Mar '97	 Feb '97	Mar '96</p>
<p>    Seasonally adjusted  100.0	   106.2	  100.6</p>
<p>    Actual		   103.8	   104.7	  104.8</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
